<?php
return ['name' => 'attuned_xin_metal_the_refiner', 'displayTitle' => ['en' => 'Attuned Xin Metal – The Refiner', 'zh' => '身弱辛金'], 'locales' => ['en' => ['sections' => ['overview' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<p>Xin Metal in an attuned state is like a raw gem that needs careful cutting and polishing to reveal its luster. Lacking overwhelming force, it relies on patience and refinement to become truly valuable. As an Attuned Xin Metal, its strength comes from diligently honing itself. It has the potential to be the calm eye in the storm – the one that stays clear-minded when things get chaotic. By applying resilience and wisdom in its chosen field, it cultivates an unshakeable worth. Its power may appear soft, but it\'s precise, steady, and noble, proving that quiet persistence can outshine brute force.</p><p>Delicate & Thorough: You have a cool, composed demeanor and a keen attention to detail. Conscientious and methodical, you strive for perfection and uphold rules, sometimes to the point of being too hard on yourself when things aren\'t \'just so\'.<br/>Quietly Principled: There\'s a steel core beneath your gentle appearance. Under pressure, you remain outwardly calm and pliant, but you stand firmly by your principles. You dislike open conflict, yet if someone crosses a line you deem inviolable, you will not yield an inch.<br/>Sensitive & Analytical: Highly observant and thoughtful, you process life through logic and analysis. This means you rarely act rashly, but it can also lead to analysis paralysis – weighing options for so long that opportunities slip by. Building more confidence in your gut instincts and daring to act will help balance this tendency.</p>'], 'love' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<p>Earth and Metal. In your \'unpolished\' form, you might struggle with self-confidence or asserting yourself. Earth energy provides stability, nourishment, and a sense of security, like a supportive soil where you can take root and grow stronger. Additional Metal energy reinforces your inner resolve and clarity. By embracing Earth and Metal, you strengthen your core – bolstering your confidence, decisiveness, and endurance so that your talents can shine through without wavering.</p>'], 'career' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<h4>Wealth</h4><p>For you, slow and steady truly wins the race. You may not care for chasing speculative windfalls, and that\'s a good thing – your finances flourish through steady accumulation. A stable career with regular income and savings can lead you to comfort and even abundance over time. In fact, the older you get, the more your \'financial reservoir\' is likely to grow, as careful decisions compound into wealth. You do well partnering with established institutions or mentors; long-term collaborations and having reputable backing can boost your earnings and security. Avoid get-rich-quick schemes or high-risk gambles – they\'d bring more stress than reward. Instead, focus on monetizing your expertise. Whether through technical skills, specialized knowledge, or a craft you\'ve perfected, you can create a reliable stream of income. Your financial strategy is like tending a garden: plant seeds early, tend patiently, and harvest consistently – it will yield plenty in the long run.</p><h4>Health</h4><p>Keep an eye on your heart and circulation. Stress or strong emotions can sometimes hit you physically (for instance, a fast heartbeat when you\'re anxious). Incorporate moderate cardio exercise like brisk walking, swimming, or cycling to strengthen your cardiovascular system and act as a mood stabilizer. Make sure to pace yourself and not push too hard – consistency matters more than intensity. Also, give special care to your eyes. If you work at a computer or do a lot of reading (likely, given your analytical nature), practice the 20-20-20 rule: every 20 minutes, look at something 20 feet away for 20 seconds to reduce eye strain. Maintaining good sleep habits is crucial for you; your body and mind recuperate deeply during rest, keeping your immune system strong. A balanced diet rich in fruits and vegetables will provide the vitamins and antioxidants you need to stay healthy. In sum, listen to your body\'s signals, nurture it with regular routines, and you\'ll enjoy enduring well-being.</p><h4>Emotional Wellbeing</h4><p>Your mind is often in overdrive, analyzing every angle – which means anxiety and overthinking can be familiar foes. It\'s important for you to regularly clear your mental cache. Embrace calming practices that allow you to unplug from constant analysis. Meditation or mindfulness exercises, even just 10 minutes a day, can train you to let thoughts pass without grabbing onto each one. Creative hobbies can also serve as therapy: painting, journaling, or playing a musical instrument lets you express feelings indirectly and break the cycle of rumination. You might also explore gentle art therapy or yoga – activities that connect body and mind gently, helping emotions flow out rather than bottling up. By engaging in these soothing practices, you\'ll find that your worries loosen their grip, leaving you with a clearer, calmer state of mind.</p><h4>Career Pathways</h4><p>Where You Flourish: Finance & Accounting: Careers in banking, bookkeeping, accounting, auditing, or risk assessment are excellent for your methodical approach. You bring integrity and thoroughness, catching mistakes others overlook and ensuring stability in financial matters. Education & Archival Sciences: As a teacher, librarian, or archivist, you can organize information and guide others patiently. You also thrive in social work or community welfare positions where careful planning and genuine compassion are needed. The structured environment of public service roles lets you make a quiet difference. Administrative Roles: Whether as a civil servant, a staff member in a public institution, or a human resources/admin professional in a company, you excel at keeping operations running smoothly. Your reliability and attention to protocol ensure that nothing falls through the cracks. Healthcare & Therapy: Pharmacies, clinics, and therapy centers benefit from your caring precision. You would make a conscientious pharmacist, an effective acupuncturist balancing science and art, a gentle dentist, a devoted nurse, or a skilled physical/rehabilitation therapist. These roles let you help others heal in a controlled, calm setting. Data & Precision Tech: You are well-suited for behind-the-scenes tech and data roles. Think data analyst, IT system administrator, quality control specialist, or precision instrument technician. In these jobs, your knack for fine detail and steady process creates flawless results, and you\'ll take pride in catching what everyone else misses. Where Energy Feels Drained: Unpredictable Creative Fields: Fast-paced, high-variation careers in advertising, creative media, or being a freelance writer/journalist could leave you frazzled. The constant change and deadline pressure, without clear structure, clash with your need for order and ample time to do things right. Speculative Finance: Day trading, high-frequency trading, or aggressive venture capital roles demand quick, high-stakes decisions and a stomach for big risks. These would likely create too much stress and uncertainty for you. Your financial style is more tortoise than hare, and that\'s okay – avoid the stock market rollercoaster in favor of steadier tracks. Heavy Construction or Forestry: Jobs like large-scale construction management, logging, or outdoor engineering are physically demanding and often chaotic due to weather and other variables. The rough-and-tumble environment could overwhelm your preference for careful planning and indoor intellectual work. Intense Trade & Shipping: Roles in international trade, shipping logistics, or being a solo import-export entrepreneur involve constant negotiation, travel, and fluctuations in markets. The lack of routine and the high-pressure deal-making might be more draining than exciting for you. Similarly, working as a full-time freelancer (without a stable structure or team) could prove challenging – you do better with a dependable framework rather than juggling the unknowns of gig life.</p>'], 'relationship_friends' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>Ji Earth: You benefit from friends who supply the stability or boldness you sometimes lack. Ji Earth friends (comforting Yin Earth) offer you steady support and patience, helping to ease your anxieties with their reliability.</li><li>Geng Metal: On the other hand, friends with Geng Metal energy (strong Yang Metal) inspire you to be more daring and proactive. Their go-getter attitude and decisiveness rub off on you, giving you that push to act when you\'d otherwise hesitate.</li></ul>'], 'relationship_couple' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>Wu Earth: A Wu Earth partner\'s solid, grounding presence can dissolve your bouts of self-doubt and worry. They create a safe, structured environment where you feel more in control of your life.</li><li>Geng Metal: Similarly, a Geng Metal partner complements you by adding toughness and direction to the relationship. They\'ll encourage you to take the lead occasionally and bolster you during big decisions.</li></ul>'], 'celebrities_international' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>Angelina Jolie: Hollywood actress and humanitarian. She uses her platform thoughtfully, advocating for children\'s education, refugees, and wildlife conservation with steady commitment</li><li>Lady Gaga: Pop superstar and activist. Beyond her artistic innovation, she\'s a methodical advocate for LGBTQ+ rights and mental health, even helping raise over $100 million for worthy causes</li><li>Marie Curie: Pioneering scientist, the first woman to win a Nobel Prize (and she won it twice). She meticulously researched radioactive elements, ultimately revolutionizing cancer treatment</li><li>Jean‑Paul Sartre: Influential existentialist philosopher known for his phrase \'existence precedes essence.\' Sartre was uncompromising in his intellectual ideals and famously even declined the Nobel Prize in Literature to stay true to his principles</li></ul>'], 'celebrities_domestic' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>Robin Li (Li Yanhong): Co-founder of Baidu, China\'s top search engine. A tech visionary who quietly and steadily built an Internet empire</li><li>Sun Yat-sen: Leader of the Xinhai Revolution and founding father of modern China. Though a revolutionary, he was known for carefully crafting his ideology (\'Three Principles of the People\') and persistently uniting people under a common vision</li></ul>'], 'luckSuggestion_dailyTips' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>Wear or carry metal accessories more often – whether it\'s a favorite piece of jewelry, a metal keychain, or even metallic-framed glasses</li><li>Place a ceramic ornament (like a clay sculpture or ceramic bowl) in your home or workspace. Earth-element objects like ceramics emit a grounding energy that can help calm your nerves</li></ul>'], 'luckSuggestion_color' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>Yellow (Earth): Yellow brings the energy of stability, nourishment, and comfort. It\'s an excellent color to help you feel more secure and less anxious. You might keep a yellow notepad for jotting down tasks, or wear a soft yellow scarf – these touches can provide a subconscious sense of being supported. Yellow literally brightens your outlook, encouraging a more relaxed and confident mood.</li><li>White & Gold (Metal): White and gold are colors of purity, clarity, and refined strength. White (like the gleam of a polished blade) can clear mental fog and enhance decisiveness, while gold adds a sense of prestige and boldness. Try using a white or gold phone case, pen, or wallet. Even decorating a corner of your room with white/gold fabrics or lights can amplify your Metal element luck, making you feel more assertive and in control when needed.</li></ul>'], 'luckSuggestion_location' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>Center (Earth): Embrace the center in both physical spaces and social settings. In a room, the center is often the calmest spot – consider meditating or doing stretches in the middle of your living area to absorb Earth\'s grounding energy. Being central in your network (connecting people, hosting gatherings, or simply positioning your work desk centrally) can also draw supportive energies to you. This central Earth energy helps keep you steady, rational, and composed, no matter the chaos around.</li><li>West (Metal): West is the direction of the setting sun – think of it as condensing the day\'s energy into wisdom and confidence. Facing west when you work or study can bolster your self-assurance. If you have an important meeting or presentation, try to sit so you\'re looking westward; it may subconsciously reinforce your courage. Likewise, keep reminders of your achievements on the western side of your room (like certificates or trophies displayed on a west wall). This orientation aligns with Metal energy to make you feel decisive and bold when it counts.</li></ul>']]], 'zh' => ['sections' => ['overview' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<p>辛金为珠玉之金，身弱则需要滋养与打磨才能显贵。它应通过耐心与细致，雕琢自身，成为乱局中清醒的掌局者。</p><p>细腻周全：气质清冷细腻，处事谨慎周全，注重规则与细节，追求完美但易自我苛责。<br/>坚持原则：内在坚韧，遇压力时外柔内刚，不喜冲突但原则问题寸步不让。<br/>敏感理性：敏感多思，依赖逻辑分析，易因过度权衡而错失机会，需培养果敢魄力。</p>'], 'love' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<p>身弱辛金，喜用神为土、金。身弱辛金力量不足，容易缺乏自信与锐气。</p>'], 'career' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<h4>财富运势</h4><p>细水长流最稳妥，上班攒钱也能过得滋润。年纪越大，财库越丰。可依托长期合作或权威背书获利。</p><h4>健康隐患</h4><p>关注心血管健康，适度运动，控制情绪波动；缓解眼部疲劳；提升免疫力。</p><h4>情绪管理</h4><p>易焦虑多思，需要通过静心、艺术疗愈等方式疏解。</p><h4>职业管理</h4><p>推荐行业：金融投资：证券投资、基金管理、金融咨询。法律：律师事务所、法律顾问、法院工作。审计：财务审计、内控审核、风险评估。机械制造：精密制造、机械设计、设备制造。精密仪器：医疗器械、精密仪器、测量设备。物流：物流管理、仓储配送、供应链管理。水利工程：水资源管理、水利建设、水务管理。器械制造：医疗器械、机械制造、精密器械。慎重行业：农业种植：农场经营、农产品、农业合作社。陶艺制作：陶瓷工艺、手工艺品、艺术创作。仓储管理：仓库管理、物流仓储、供应链管理。重工业流水线：重工业制造、自动化生产、工业生产。金属矿产开采：采矿业、矿产开发、地质勘探。竞技体育：职业运动员、体育竞技、高风险运动。</p>'], 'relationship_friends' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>己土：己土提供稳定感和包容力，能够化解你的焦虑。</li><li>庚金：庚金补足你的决断力和行动力。</li></ul>'], 'relationship_couple' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>戊土：戊土化解你的脆弱多疑，让你对生活更有掌控感。</li><li>庚金：庚金刚毅弥补你的韧性不足，在重大决策前可以给你指明方向。</li></ul>'], 'celebrities_international' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>Angelina Jolie：好莱坞明星，支持儿童教育、女性权益与野生动物保护</li><li>Lady Gaga：歌手，为LGBTQ+群体与性侵幸存者发声筹款超1亿美元</li><li>Marie Curie：首位诺贝尔奖女性得主，发现镭和钋，开创放射性治疗癌症先河</li><li>Jean-Paul Sartre：存在主义哲学领袖，提出\'存在先于本质\'</li></ul>'], 'celebrities_domestic' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>李彦宏：百度创始人</li><li>罗翔：法学教授，普法视频播放超10亿次，推动法治观念普及</li><li>孙中山：辛亥革命领袖，推翻帝制，提出\'三民主义\'，被尊为\'国父\'</li></ul>'], 'luckSuggestion_dailyTips' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>可以多带一些金属配饰</li><li>摆放陶瓷摆件</li></ul>'], 'luckSuggestion_color' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>黄色（土）：黄色象征稳固与根基，能增强稳定性，让辛金在复杂环境中保持从容。日常多用黄色小物件，让心态更踏实。</li><li>白色 / 金色（金）：白色与金色象征清晰与锐气，能提升果敢与行动力，让辛金在关键时刻更有执行力。适度融入白金色元素，让行动更自信。</li></ul>'], 'luckSuggestion_location' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>中部（土）：中部的能量象征沉稳与厚实，有助于沉淀心性，让辛金保持稳定与理智。</li><li>西方（金）：西方的能量象征自信与果敢，能帮助辛金增强自信，让行动更坚定、决策更果断。</li></ul>']]]], 'version' => 1];
